  "system": {
    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>Countdown (Loop 2d6). When the Machine is spotlighted for the first time, activate the countdown. It ticks down each time the Machine is spotlighted. When it triggers, place a token on this stat block as the Machine's chest crucible flares with magical flame. For each token on this stat block, the Machine gains a +1 bonus to Difficulty and attack rolls, and its standard attack deals an extra <strong>1d12</strong> damage. Remove a token when the Machine takes Severe damage.</p>",
